# Legacy redirects for docs.olivares.ai
#
# These routes preserve previously promised external links and bookmarks.
# A source-tree check on 2026-08-25 found 25 mentions of /cli and 10 of
# /quickstart. Their destinations are reference/cli.md and start/quickstart.md.
# At that check, the product emitted only /reference/api-stability/.
#
# Example placeholders (/X, /y, /a/b-c, /x, /...) and the
# /how-to/migrate-example Link-header example are not redirect routes.
# /.well-known/security.txt and /og-image.png are served directly from public/.
# No locale variants such as /es/cli or /ja/quickstart were found in that check.
#
# Workers static assets reads _redirects from the asset directory
# (public/ is copied to dist/, the directory declared by wrangler.jsonc).
# Platform limits: 2000 static rules, 100 dynamic rules, 1000 characters per rule.
# The Worker handles trailing slashes with html_handling: auto-trailing-slash.

/cli/*         /reference/cli/    301
/cli           /reference/cli/    301
/quickstart/*  /start/quickstart/ 301
/quickstart    /start/quickstart/ 301
